// title: the hunt for the hermeticreader
// date: 2026-11-02
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceFileEvents
// purpose: the hunt for the hermeticreader
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Detections.AI/blob/e9aedb2826722ccf078f2d099a8f5faac74f704d/KQL/the-hunt-for-the-hermeticreader.kql
// kind: repo
